      value: 'One office laptop is currently listed as unavailable. The equipment
        record indicates that the laptop was previously assigned to the Administration
        Department.



        The equipment has not yet been returned to the designated
        storage area. The responsible staff member is expected to confirm the current
        location of the laptop and update the inventory record accordingly.

'
