    - target: {fileID: 7613939286406606026, guid: 17aa6a2b1f6158845ad62563c7fd919a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The meeting began with a review of the team''s progress during the
        previous week. Most of the scheduled tasks have been completed, although
        several items remain pending due to additional revisions requested by the
        client.



        The project coordinator reported that the current project
        remains within the expected timeline. However, the team was reminded that
        all outstanding documentation should be completed before the next client
        review.



        The Finance Department also provided an update regarding
        the remaining project budget. No major budget issues were reported, although
        several recent equipment purchases will need to be included in the next expense
        report.



        The team then discussed the upcoming deadline. All members
        agreed that the remaining documentation and testing should be completed by
        the end of the week. Additional meetings will be scheduled if any major issues
        are discovered during testing.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
