    - target: {fileID: 7613939286406606026, guid: 17aa6a2b1f6158845ad62563c7fd919a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The employee has maintained a generally consistent attendance record
        throughout the reporting period. Two late arrivals were recorded during the
        month, both occurring within the first fifteen minutes of the scheduled working
        hours.



        No unexplained absences were recorded during this period.
        The employee has completed the required attendance records for all scheduled
        working days.



        This report is intended for internal administrative
        purposes only. Any discrepancies in the attendance records should be reported
        to the Administration Department within five working days of receiving this
        report.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
